  notes: >-
    Publishes an Obsidian vault straight to the web for free, with
    client-side full-text search and a graph view. Named as the most common
    free alternative to the paid Obsidian Publish add-on, and the shortest
    path from private notes to a public garden for teams already living in
    Obsidian.
